{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7a1c2d3-e4f5-6789-abcd-ef0123456789",
    "name": "Gymora API",
    "description": "# Gymora API Postman Collection\n\n## Overview\n\nComplete Postman collection for the Gymora ASP.NET Core 9.0 REST API.\n\n## Architecture\n\n- **Authentication:** JWT Bearer Token with Refresh Tokens\n- **Identity:** ASP.NET Core Identity with `ApplicationUser` (int PK)\n- **Roles:** `SuperAdmin`, `User`\n- **Rate Limiting:** IP-based fixed window policies\n- **Global Exception Handling:** Custom middleware returning `Result<T>` envelope\n- **ORM:** Entity Framework Core with SQL Server\n- **Background Jobs:** Hangfire + MassTransit InMemory + EF Outbox\n- **File Storage:** Bunny.net (Stream + Storage)\n- **Payment:** Paymob integration\n- **Validation:** DataAnnotations\n\n## Authentication Flow\n\n1. `POST /api/Auth/register` — Creates account + sends confirmation OTP\n2. `POST /api/Auth/confirm-email` — Confirms with OTP (or use GET variant)\n3. `POST /api/Auth/login` — Returns JWT + Refresh Token\n4. All protected requests automatically use `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`\n5. `POST /api/Auth/refresh-token` — When access token expires\n6. `POST /api/Auth/logout` — Revokes refresh token\n\n## Rate Limiting Policies\n\n| Policy Name | Limit | Window | Endpoints |\n|------------|-------|--------|-----------|\n| `Ip_5Limit_1Min` | 5 requests | 1 minute | POST /api/Auth/login |\n| `Ip_3Limit_5Min` | 3 requests | 5 minutes | POST resend-confirmation-email, POST forgot-password |\n| `Ip_10Limit_1Min` | 10 requests | 1 minute | POST verify-otp, POST reset-password, GET confirm-email |\n\n## Standard Response Envelope\n\n### Success\n```json\n{\n  \"isSuccess\": true,\n  \"data\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\n### Error\n```json\n{\n  \"isSuccess\": false,\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\",\n    \"message\": \"Description\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Error Codes\n\n| HTTP Status | Code | Description |\n|------------|------|-------------|\n| 400 | `BAD_REQUEST` | Invalid input / business rule violation |\n| 400 | `VALIDATION_ERROR` | Model state validation failure |\n| 401 | `UNAUTHORIZED` | Missing or invalid authentication |\n| 403 | `FORBIDDEN` | Insufficient role permissions |\n| 404 | `NOT_FOUND` | Resource not found |\n| 429 | `RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED` | Rate limit triggered |\n| 500 | `INTERNAL_ERROR` | Unexpected server error |\n\n## Roles\n\n| Role | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `SuperAdmin` | Full system access (value: 0) |\n| `User` | Standard authenticated user (value: 1) |\n\n## Enums\n\n### FileType\n| Value | Name |\n|-------|------|\n| 0 | Video |\n| 1 | PDF |\n| 2 | Audio |\n| 3 | Document |\n| 4 | Image |\n| 5 | Other |\n\n### BunnyUploadStatus\n| Value | Name |\n|-------|------|\n| 0 | Queued |\n| 1 | Processing |\n| 2 | Encoding |\n| 3 | Finished |\n| 4 | ResolutionFinished |\n| 5 | Failed |\n| 6 | PresignedUploadStarted |\n| 7 | PresignedUploadFinished |\n| 8 | PresignedUploadFailed |\n| 9 | CaptionsGenerated |\n| 10 | TitleOrDescriptionGenerated |\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- **Email:** SMTP via Gmail (`MailOptions`)\n- **Firebase:** Cloud Messaging for push notifications\n- **Bunny.net:** Video streaming + file storage\n- **Redis:** Caching (optional, configured per environment)\n- **Hangfire:** Background job processing\n- **MassTransit:** InMemory message bus with EF Outbox\n\n## Collection Variables\n\n| Variable | Auto-Set By | Description |\n|----------|------------|-------------|\n| `baseUrl` | — | API base URL (set per environment) |\n| `accessToken` | Login, LoginGoogle, RefreshToken | JWT Bearer token |\n| `refreshToken` | Login, LoginGoogle, RefreshToken | Refresh token |\n| `currentUserId` | Login, LoginGoogle | Authenticated user ID |\n| `createdEntityId` | Create SubscriptionPlan | Created entity ID for chaining |\n| `createdPlanPriceId` | Create PlanPrice | Created plan price ID |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
