            "description": "Authenticate with email and password.\n\nOn success, **accessToken** and **refreshToken** are automatically saved as collection variables.\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n| Field | Rule |\n|-------|------|\n| `email` | Required |\n| `password` | Required |\n\n## Response Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | number | User ID |\n| `email` | string | User email |\n| `personName` | string | Display name |\n| `token` | string | JWT access token |\n| `expiresIn` | number | Token expiration in seconds |\n| `refreshtoken` | string | Refresh token |\n| `roles` | string[] | Assigned roles |\n| `refreshTokenExpirationDate` | string | Refresh token expiry (ISO-8601) |\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n`Ip_5Limit_1Min`: **5 requests per 1 minute** per IP."
